 142              	/***********************************************************************************
 143              	 *
 144              	 * config_32_copy () Copies a word at a time, used when copying to contigous registers
 145              	 */
 146              	    // config_copy helper function:
 147              	    //  a0 = dest
 148              	    //  a1 = src
